    "detailed_description": "Our main character, Nemo, goes to school again today.<br />\r\nI go up and up to go to school 351m above the sky.<br />\r\nYou can't help it if you fall. You have to go up without a break to not be late!<br />\r\nThere are bad weather and dangerous stairs above. You have to hold back even if you're angry.<br />\r\nNow, head to school!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBasically, this game is a speed-run game that passes through a difficult map in the shortest time.<br />\r\nThe game also has several Easter eggs hidden in it, and you can enjoy your content without getting tired of it through your achievements.<br />\r\nThe title screen also allows you to move the player to perform several activities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow to move players:<br />\r\nThe square can be moved from side to side through the A/D key or rudder on the keyboard.<br />\r\nBy clicking the mouse, you can jump up to 2 times with the force of the jump.<br />\r\nTypically, contact with an object gives you a jump force.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSpecial Block:<br />\r\nA red block cannot gain jumping force even if it touches it.<br />\r\nOrange blocks have the property of turning.<br />\r\nThe mint block only moves up and down, and disappears after 3 seconds of contact.<br />\r\nBlue blocks have various properties.",
